        "description": "",
        "id": 4,
        "links": [],
        "title": "How to read this",
        "vizConfig": {
          "group": "text",
          "kind": "VizConfig",
          "spec": {
            "fieldConfig": {
              "defaults": {},
              "overrides": []
            },
            "options": {
              "mode": "markdown",
              "content": "### How to read this dashboard\n\n**Hit rate = CORRECT ÷ (CORRECT + INCORRECT)** — *neutral calls are excluded*, so a low hit rate and a low sample size often go together.\n\n- 🟢 **CORRECT** — the call's thesis played out within the horizon.\n- ⚪ **NEUTRAL** — the move was too small to judge (not counted in the hit rate).\n- 🔴 **INCORRECT** — the price moved against the call.\n\n**Decisiveness** = share of graded calls that were *not* neutral. All tiles and tables use the **7-day** horizon unless noted. Use the time picker (top-right) to scope a period.",
              "code": {
                "language": "plaintext",
                "showLineNumbers": false,
                "showMiniMap": false
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "panel-5": {
      "kind": "Panel",
      "spec": {
        "data": {
          "kind": "QueryGroup",
          "spec": {
            "queries": [
              {
                "kind": "PanelQuery",
                "spec": {
                  "hidden": false,
                  "query": {
                    "datasource": {
                      "name": "cfadv004ogglcf"
                    },
                    "group": "mysql",
                    "kind": "DataQuery",
                    "spec": {
                      "editorMode": "code",
                      "format": "table",
                      "rawQuery": true,
                      "rawSql": "SELECT\n  UNIX_TIMESTAMP(DATE(generated_at) - INTERVAL WEEKDAY(generated_at) DAY) AS time_sec,\n  ROUND(100*SUM(verdict='CORRECT' AND horizon_days=7)/\n    NULLIF(SUM(verdict IN('CORRECT','INCORRECT') AND horizon_days=7),0),0)  AS `7d hit %`,\n  ROUND(100*SUM(verdict='CORRECT' AND horizon_days=30)/\n    NULLIF(SUM(verdict IN('CORRECT','INCORRECT') AND horizon_days=30),0),0) AS `30d hit %`,\n  SUM(horizon_days=7 AND verdict IN('CORRECT','INCORRECT'))                 AS `7d decided`\nFROM recommendation_outcomes\nWHERE $__timeFilter(generated_at)\nGROUP BY time_sec\nORDER BY time_sec"
                    },
                    "version": "v0"
                  },
                  "refId": "A"
                }
              }
            ],
            "queryOptions": {},
            "transformations": []
          }
        },
        "description": "Weekly hit rate by horizon (Monday-anchored weeks). The light bars (right axis) show how many 7-day calls were decided that week — thin bars mean a noisy hit rate.",
        "id": 5,
        "links": [],
        "title": "Hit rate over time (weekly)",
